        <div class="content active" id="merchandising" data-reveal data-animation-in="spin-in">
            <div class="row ">
                <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-left">
                    <div class="tab-text ">
                      <div class="headline text-left">
                             Infinity Merchandising
                        </div>
                      <div class="text text-left">
                             Easily showcase the most relevant products with the perfect mix of AI automation and manual control. This module helps you present products based on shopper behavior, market trends and your business goals. Tools like local pinning, redirects, Pulse insights and the Experience Editor make it simple to ensure the right shoppers always see the right products at the right time.
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-wrapper">
                                <a href="/products/infinity-merchandising.html">Learn more</a>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-right">
                        <div class="tab-image">
                            <img src="/media/tab_image/place_products_wherever_you_want-01.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Infinity Merchandising" width="500px" height="441px">
                        </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content " id="navigation" data-reveal data-animation-in="spin-in">
            <div class="row ">
                <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-left">
                    <div class="tab-text ">
                      <div class="headline text-left">
                             Infinity Navigation
                        </div>
                      <div class="text text-left">
                             Make browsing effortless by showing each customer products that match their intent and preferences. Infinity’s AI adapts instantly to how shoppers explore your site — whether through categories, search or both. It highlights products based on preferences, like color or price, and ranks them using business rules and popularity, helping shoppers find what they want while supporting your business goals.
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-wrapper">
                                <a href="/products/infinity-navigation.html">Learn more</a>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-right">
                        <div class="tab-image">
                            <img src="/media/tab_image/02_infinity_navigation_intent.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Infinity Navigation" width="500px" height="441px">
                        </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content " id="recommendations" data-reveal data-animation-in="spin-in">
            <div class="row ">
                <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-left">
                    <div class="tab-text ">
                      <div class="headline text-left">
                             Infinity Recommendations
                        </div>
                      <div class="text text-left">
                             Increase shopping cart sizes with personalized product recommendations. Powered by advanced AI, Infinity Recommendations analyzes shopper behavior in detail to deliver suggestions that go beyond basic "frequently purchased together" items. It identifies truly relevant products from your entire catalog, tailoring recommendations to each shopper’s unique preferences and needs.
                        </div>
                        <div class="button-wrapper">
                                <a href="/products/infinity-recommendations.html">Learn more</a>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            <div class="small-12 large-6 columns tabcontent-right">
