<div class="small-12 columns library_titel">FirstVet boosts AOV by 12.22%</div>

<div class="small-12 columns library_description">FirstVet set out to achieve two key goals: increasing average order value and delivering a seamless, delightful shopping experience. Integrating recommendations led to a 12.22% AOV increase, while the smooth implementation supported market expansion and enhanced customer satisfaction.</div>
</div>
</div><div class="benefit__link"><a href="/resources/case-studies/firstvet.html" class="button filled light">read more</a></div></div></div><div class="small-12 medium-4 columns text-left"><div class="benefit left" data-equalizer-watch><div class="benefit__icon"><picture>
<source srcset="/media/ff_png/deonlinedrogist_download.webp" type="image/png">
