            loading="lazy"
            /></picture>
<noscript>
                    <img src="/media/deonlinedrogist_download.webp"  title="Verschiedene Tablettenblister auf einem blauen Hintergrund, mit dem Logo von De Online Drogist.nl." alt="Verschiedene Tablettenblister auf einem blauen Hintergrund, mit dem Logo von De Online Drogist.nl." width="1000" height="720"  loading="lazy"/>
                 </noscript></div><div class="benefit__text"><h4></h4><hr><div class="small-12 columns library_tags">
<div class="button-bar">
<ul class="button-group">
	<li class="button">Pharmacy</li>
	<li class="button">B2C</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="small-12 columns library_titel">Conversion rate boosted by 12% with intelligent search</div>

<div class="small-12 columns library_description">DeOnlineDrogist outgrew its old search engine as its product catalog expanded and customer expectations soared. They turned to a smarter solution to handle these challenges, resulting in +12% conversion and a faster, more intuitive shopping experience.</div>
</div>
</div><div class="benefit__link"><a href="/media/online_drogiest_case_study.pdf" class="button filled light">read more</a></div></div></div><div class="small-12 medium-4 columns text-left end"><div class="benefit left" data-equalizer-watch><div class="benefit__icon"><picture>
