    <section class="qanda">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="small-12 medium-4 columns">
                <h2>FAQs for customers</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="small-12 medium-8 columns">
                <details><summary>Will my pricing or contract change?</summary><div class="answer"><p>No, your pricing and contract will remain exactly the same. The only change is that you’ll now be visiting <a href="/">fact-finder.com</a> instead of www.loop54.com for information and resources.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>What’s happening to the Loop54 support team?</summary><div class="answer"><p>There are no changes to the support team. You’ll continue to receive the same high-quality support from the same team you know. If you have any questions or need assistance, you can reach out to us at <a href="mailto:service-desk@fact-finder.com">service-desk@fact-finder.com</a>.  </p>
</div></details><details><summary>Do I need to make any updates on my end?</summary><div class="answer"><p>No updates are required on your end. We recommend updating your bookmarks to <a href="/">fact-finder.com</a> to ensure easy access to the resources you need.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>Will I still have access to all the features I use now?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes, all the features and services you currently rely on will stay the same. There’s no disruption to your service.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>Where do I log in to Infinity?</summary><div class="answer"><p>The link to the Infinity portal remains the same. You can log in <a href="https://portal.loop54.com/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">here</a>, or find the login link at the top right of <a href="/">fact-finder.com</a> under “Support.” If you need assistance with your login credentials, please contact our support team at <a rel="noopener">service-desk@fact-finder.com</a>.</p>
</div></details>            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTPUT [HTML-Code and Picture] NEW--><section style=" background-color: #f2e8fc; " >
<div class="row " >
<div style=" background-color: #f2e8fc; " class="HCaPC text-center " >
</div>

<div class=" horizontal clearfix" style=" padding: 0 !important; ">
        <hr  style="background-color: #220b81;""/>
    </div>
<!-- OUTPUT [HTML-Code and Picture] NEW--><div style=" background-color: #f2e8fc; " class="HCaPC text-center " >
</div>
</div>
</section>

    <section class="qanda">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="small-12 medium-4 columns">
                <h2>FAQs for partners</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="small-12 medium-8 columns">
                <details><summary>How will this acquisition affect our partnership agreement?</summary><div class="answer"><p>It won’t. Your partnership agreement remains unchanged. If you were previously a Loop54 partner, the only difference is that you’ll now be accessing <a href="/">fact-finder.com</a> instead of www.loop54.com.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>How will this acquisition improve the solution for our customers?</summary><div class="answer"><p>The acquisition of Loop54 by FactFinder marks a milestone in the evolution of search, merchandising, and personalization technology. Loop54’s leadership in real-time, 1:1 AI personalization, combined with FactFinder’s proven expertise, enables us to deliver transformative eCommerce experiences. Together, we’re shaping the future of online retail with solutions that offer both innovation and a sustainable competitive edge.  </p>
</div></details><details><summary>Who can I reach out to with questions about the new solution?</summary><div class="answer"><p>We’re here to help! If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:info@fact-finder.com">info@fact-finder.com</a>. You can also learn more about Infinity by exploring our brochure <a href="/media/factfinder_brochure_en.pdf" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">here</a>.  </p>
</div></details><details><summary>Do I need to update my materials to include the new name or branding?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes, if you’re still using the Loop54 name or logo, please update your materials to reflect the new branding: “FactFinder” or “FactFinder Infinity.” For <a href="/media/factfinder_logos_1.zip">the updated logo</a> or specific file formats, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:info@fact-finder.com">info@fact-finder.com</a></p>
</div></details><details><summary>What’s the best way to stay updated on future developments with the solution?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Stay connected with us on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/fact-finder/">LinkedIn</a> and subscribe to our monthly newsletter (fill out the form at the bottom of any page on <a href="/">fact-finder.com</a>) for the latest updates, news, and product developments.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>Where can I find documentation for Infinity?</summary><div class="answer"><p>You'll find everything you need on the <a href="https://docs.fact-finder.com/infinity">Infinity documentation</a> page. It includes developer guides, API references and integration details to help with your setup.</p>
</div></details>            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTPUT [HTML-Code and Picture] NEW--><section style=" background-color: #f2e8fc; " >
<div class="row " >
<div style=" background-color: #f2e8fc; " class="HCaPC text-center " >
