    <section class="qanda">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="small-12 medium-4 columns">
                <h2>FAQs for prospects</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="small-12 medium-8 columns">
                <details><summary>What makes this solution stand out from others?</summary><div class="answer"><p>FactFinder is trusted by more than 2,000 online shops in B2B and B2C to deliver superior shopping experiences. Our flexible and headless compatible platform gives eCommerce teams both automation and control, underpinned by AI and human intelligence to deliver personalized results that shoppers love.</p>
</div></details><details><summary>How does it fit into your overall product lineup?</summary><div class="answer"><p>FactFinder offers two leading solutions for product discovery and search:  </p>

<ol>
	<li><strong>Next Generation</strong>: Designed for larger eCommerce businesses that want control over the entire customer journey. It’s supported by cutting-edge AI technology to help optimize every aspect of search and merchandising.  </li>
	<li><strong>Infinity</strong> (formerly Loop54): Ideal for companies seeking a hands-off approach to search optimization, Infinity leverages advanced AI Personalization and Recommendations to drive conversions, freeing up your team to focus on other priorities.  </li>
</ol>
</div></details><details><summary>Where can I learn more about Infinity?</summary><div class="answer"><p>See Infinity in action with a customized, no-commitment demo from one of our experts. <a href="/request-demo.html">Contact our team</a> to get started! You can also explore more about Infinity in our brochure <a href="/media/factfinder_brochure_en.pdf">here</a>.</p>
</div></details>            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTPUT [HTML-Code and Picture] NEW--><section>
<div class="row " >
<div  id="about" style=" padding: 80px 0 80px 0; "
 class="HCaPC text-left  small-8 large-centered columns " >
<h2>Need more information?</h2>

<hr />
<p paraeid="{d412542d-9f3e-4075-b0a7-0cc9092cc595}{224}" paraid="793951927">If you have additional questions, our team is here to help. Email us at <a href="mailto:info@fact-finder.com"><span style="color:#aa73f2;">info@fact-finder.com</span></a><span style="color:#aa73f2;">,</span><span style="color:#ffffff;"> </span>and we’ll be happy to assist you.</p>
</div>
